| ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |
| 4 Commit | git-agent (xN) | Haiku 4.5 | NK | NK | $X.XX |
| 5a Spec review | spec-reviewer | Sonnet 4.6 | 50K | 8K | $0.31 |
| 5b Design review | design-reviewer | Sonnet 4.6 | 50K | 8K | $0.31 |
